177 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (The system collects and preprocesses insect images using image enhancement and data augmentation techniques. A Convolutional Neural Network \(CNN\) model is trained to identify and classify crop pests accurately. Farmers upload crop images through a mobile or web application for real-time pest detection. The AI model analyzes the image and predicts the insect type along with infestation details. Based on the prediction results, the system recommends suitable pesticides and preventive measures to the farmer.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
