/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (The AI-based system successfully detects and classifies crop insects with high accuracy using deep learning techniques. Real-time pest identification helps farmers take faster and more effective decisions for crop protection. The pesticide recommendation feature reduces excessive chemical usage and lowers farming costs. The system promotes sustainable agriculture by minimizing environmental damage and improving soil health. Overall, the project demonstrates the potential of AI and computer vision in modern smart farming practices.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
